  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine fish sauce, soy sauce, sugar, garlic, and ginger. Add pork shoulder and marinate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat. Thread pork onto bamboo skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill pork for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "While pork is cooking, heat oil in a small pan over medium heat. Add onion and cook for 3-4 minutes, or until slightly caramelized.",
    "To assemble, place a portion of noodles on a plate, top with grilled pork, pickled carrots, and caramelized onion.",
    "Serve with sweet chili sauce on the side and garnish with fresh herbs."
